{
  "embeddedAssets": {
    "assets": [
      {
        "dataBase64": "",
        "id": "sample.stylized-clouds.noiseMap",
        "mime": "image/png",
        "name": "cloud-noise.png"
      }
    ],
    "bindings": {
      "noiseMap": "sample.stylized-clouds.noiseMap"
    }
  },
  "format": "kshader",
  "generator": "Kekenik Shader",
  "graph": {
    "comments": [
      {
        "color": "#60a5fa",
        "id": "note_inputs",
        "position": {
          "x": 22,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 848
        },
        "text": "Mesh position / normal / UV for the vertex lumps, world normal and view direction for the shading."
      },
      {
        "color": "#4ade80",
        "id": "note_lumps",
        "position": {
          "x": 1074,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 73,
          "w": 542
        },
        "text": "**Displacement Texture** (vertex stage, LOD sample): `position += normal × (noise − ½) × height`. A texture lookup is far cheaper than evaluating fbm per vertex, and the same texture is reused in the fragment stage."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_shade",
        "position": {
          "x": 1074,
          "y": 597
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2072
        },
        "text": "`wrap = ½·N·L + ½`; colour = `lerp(shadow, lit, smoothstep(½ − soft/2, ½ + soft/2, wrap))`. The fragment noise sample darkens the inside: `colour × (1 − (1 − noise) × noiseShade)`."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fbbf24",
        "id": "note_lining",
        "position": {
          "x": 3350,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2378
        },
        "text": "`lining = (1 − N·V)^power × saturate(dot(L, −V) + 0.3)`: the rim is bright only where the sun is behind the cloud as seen from the camera. Added in HDR on top of the shaded colour."
      },
      {
        "color": "#f87171",
        "id": "note_alpha",
        "position": {
          "x": 3350,
          "y": 759
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 1154
        },
        "text": "`density = N·V + (noise − ½) × erosion`; `alpha = smoothstep(cutoff, cutoff + softness, density)`. Facing parts stay opaque; the silhouette dissolves along the noise instead of ending in a hard circle."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 5932,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Alpha blend, ZWrite off; vertex position from the lump displacement."
      }
    ],
